    "name": "Tentacaliens: Making Ends Meet in a New World",
    "steam_appid": 3531990,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/ad4276c2fb5b179a1405e48a2ff9354f.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A long time ago, in a galaxy far, far away there exists a Galactic Empire ruled by Emperor Paipatine the 6969th. The Empire has been warring with rebels for many years, and both sides desperately desire something to boost their spirits from the fighting... And that's where our hero steps in. Squid Inkwell, a tentacalien, is itching for his opportunity to conquer another planet to expand his species's joy-bringing enterprise, and that time has finally come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/a4491ad64fa9ab20ce88b4721c7feb9d.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Capture the people of Earth using your powers as a tentacalien, putting them to work at your operation in order to pay your dues to the Galactic Empire and take over the planet. Raise the stats of your workers, gather ExP, and make Cheat Items to fortify your operation or you'll find the Empire knocking at the door. Also, don't forget the most important thing... placing the top brass of the world under your feeler!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/6a00179cb6d0bddb1fd6ed4a78b6a170.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/e2e76147d0895ca4b163647f6a5e3b6d.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/c9df6773d3f4568860465e58c98f9494.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/bbe09b884ead8c9aeb29dc11df4e5413.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/3711e750ad2dfc02615f0539e2b79d71.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Art of Management</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the thrills of setting up and running a business from stage one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Gotta Abduct Them All!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plenty of people on Earth, each drawn beautifully, to capture and put to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Easy Business</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the Empire will always be breathing down your neck for its money, don't worry! It\u2019s always clear what you have to do with the help of in-game hints!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/ad4276c2fb5b179a1405e48a2ff9354f.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A long time ago, in a galaxy far, far away there exists a Galactic Empire ruled by Emperor Paipatine the 6969th. The Empire has been warring with rebels for many years, and both sides desperately desire something to boost their spirits from the fighting... And that's where our hero steps in. Squid Inkwell, a tentacalien, is itching for his opportunity to conquer another planet to expand his species's joy-bringing enterprise, and that time has finally come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/a4491ad64fa9ab20ce88b4721c7feb9d.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Capture the people of Earth using your powers as a tentacalien, putting them to work at your operation in order to pay your dues to the Galactic Empire and take over the planet. Raise the stats of your workers, gather ExP, and make Cheat Items to fortify your operation or you'll find the Empire knocking at the door. Also, don't forget the most important thing... placing the top brass of the world under your feeler!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/6a00179cb6d0bddb1fd6ed4a78b6a170.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/e2e76147d0895ca4b163647f6a5e3b6d.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/c9df6773d3f4568860465e58c98f9494.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/bbe09b884ead8c9aeb29dc11df4e5413.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/3711e750ad2dfc02615f0539e2b79d71.avif?t=1744384895\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Art of Management</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the thrills of setting up and running a business from stage one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Gotta Abduct Them All!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plenty of people on Earth, each drawn beautifully, to capture and put to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Easy Business</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the Empire will always be breathing down your neck for its money, don't worry! It\u2019s always clear what you have to do with the help of in-game hints!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
